docs {
  # GET /api/hotels/ — List zones with locations
  
  Returns paginated zones excluding `Codigo Postal`. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}` (`project/settings.py:359`). Source: `travels/views.py:13 HotelsViewSet` + `ZoneSerializer` (`travels/serializers.py:12`).
  
  ## Status codes
  
  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing or invalid token (see `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru` exemplar, same `401` for all endpoints via `utils/handlers.py:4`)
  
  ## Response (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "count": 1,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "results": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Los Cabos",
        "locations": [
          { "id": 1, "name": "Alegranza" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  Pagination envelope is `{count, next, previous, results}` per `core/pagination.py:4` (`CustomPageNumberPagination`, `page_size=12`, `max 1000`, `?page-size=`). No `page`/`total_pages`. One abbreviated item shown.
  
  ## Error (401)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  
  - `401` is cross-cutting — omitted here, see `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru`.
  - Serializer change must update this `docs` in same PR.
}
